<title>USA: Bismarck, N.D., won by Hutchinson, Shockey.</title>
<headline>Bismarck, N.D., won by Hutchinson, Shockey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson, Shockey, Erley &amp; Co., said it won $5.720 million of Bismarck, N.D., limited tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.779 percent.</p>
